---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro'
---

<Layout 
  title="Electrodynamics Cheat Sheet | Free Maxwell's Equations, EM Waves"
  description="Complete electrodynamics cheat sheet with Maxwell's equations and EM waves. Free download for physics students."
>
  <section class="hero">
    <h1>Electrodynamics<br><span>Cheat Sheet</span></h1>
    <p>Maxwell's equations and EM waves. From electrostatics to electromagnetic radiation.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Maxwell's Equations</h2>
    <div class="formula-grid">
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Differential Form</h3>
        <pre><code>∇·E = ρ/ε₀ (Gauss)
∇·B = 0 (no monopoles)
∇×E = -∂B/∂t (Faraday)
∇×B = μ₀J + μ₀ε₀∂E/∂t (Ampere-Maxwell)</code></pre>
      </div>
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Integral Form</h3>
        <pre><code>∮E·dA = Q/ε₀
∮B·dA = 0
∮E·dl = -dΦ_B/dt
∮B·dl = μ₀I + μ₀ε₀dΦ_E/dt</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Electromagnetic Waves</h2>
    <div class="formula-grid">
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Wave Equation</h3>
        <pre><code>∇²E = μ₀ε₀ ∂²E/∂t²
∇²B = μ₀ε₀ ∂²B/∂t²
c = 1/√(μ₀ε₀) = 3 × 10⁸ m/s
E/B = c (amplitude ratio)</code></pre>
      </div>
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Properties</h3>
        <pre><code>Transverse&#58; E ⊥ B ⊥ propagation
E and B in phase
Poynting vector&#58; S = E×B/μ₀
Energy density&#58; u = ½ε₀E² + B²/(2μ₀)</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Potentials</h2>
    <div class="formula-grid">
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Scalar & Vector Potentials</h3>
        <pre><code>E = -∇V - ∂A/∂t
B = ∇×A
Coulomb gauge&#58; ∇·A = 0
Lorenz gauge&#58; ∇·A + μ₀ε₀∂V/∂t = 0</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Radiation</h2>
    <div class="formula-grid">
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3> dipole Radiation</h3>
        <pre><code>Power&#58; P = μ₀p̈²/(6πc)
Radiation resistance&#58; R ∝ (d/λ)²
Antenna length&#58; d ≈ λ/4 (quarter-wave)</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Download</h2>
    <p>Print this page or save as PDF for quick reference.</p>
    <p><strong>Tip:</strong> Use Ctrl+P (Cmd+P on Mac) to print or save as PDF.</p>
  </section>
</Layout>
